{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9b08013cc34f25a821ef8b90a60f1ba2bebc6eef6d5c9ba8fb69e81e1e132407", "ja": "（39プロジェクトの始動に向けて、今日も大忙しだ。\n気合いを入れて、頑張らないとな）", "zh": "（39PROJECT即将开始，今天依旧忙得不可开交。\n我要提起精神努力加油才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "e3b708cda7ce2989f5c3be3a5f3531f67330118a4360a56378a0ec6c36fda385", "ja": "お疲れさまですっ、{$P$}！\n新しい劇場のこと、聞きました～。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n我听说新剧场的消息了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "3e3e788b8306301e2cfb26b77b93908e9cab129d378b5135fba36986e0221471", "ja": "{$P$}は、劇場のエライ人に\nなったんですよね？　すごいですーっ！", "zh": "{$P$}成了剧场的大人物\n对不对？好厉害唷──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4a2021ee08563032eafbbd569a9840e751f4ba77eb8b0c9a0e51f811fea5c1f8", "ja": "はは、まだ始まったばかりで、何もしてないけどな。\nこれからスゴくなれるよう、頑張るつもりだ。", "zh": "哈哈，企划才刚开始，我什么都还没做呢。\n我接下来会努力加油，让自己变得厉害一点的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "091adbaf0fe0b8f4fa1947f597fbb0032719d384ca5dd81f937ae71f904e00e6", "ja": "メラメラ～ってなってるんですねっ。\nでも{$P$}、今でも忙しいのに……。", "zh": "你感觉很热血沸腾～呢！不过，\n{$P$}你现在就已经忙成这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "9b815ad3c9f2d5cd1bd475ba0a3891b6f12a0427257948d2ce8cfb78404fb2ee", "ja": "ご飯とか、ちゃんと食べてますか？\nあんまり無理するのは、メッ！ですからね？", "zh": "有记得好好吃饭吗？\n绝对不能太勉强自己！听懂了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ad348c3e834285e9312f59b5d531eb25265694421e0db06b6bbe4df9b3e506e2", "ja": "はは、心配してくれてありがとう。\nでも、きっと大丈夫だと思ってるんだ。なにしろ……", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你的叮咛。\n不过，我想一定没问题的，毕竟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d1ddc4f65b861192100cc53ab2fe860c0399cd0d96018d0b61c75098afbe4c5f", "ja": "765プロには、やよいみたいに立派な先輩アイドルが\nたくさんいるからな。困った時は相談させてもらうよ。", "zh": "765艺能里，有许多像弥生这样厉害的前辈偶像在呢。\n我有麻烦时会找你们商量的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "1b556c4065865b5bfac52a50d296b160b1ce806fda550e86da9f50c723da8cdd", "ja": "はいっ！　そのときは\nどーんと、私達にまかせてください！", "zh": "没错！\n到时候就尽～管交给我们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c2682bd7cf009ade3efbd70e0f916e651e5153f2e3333582d9faa21b58f977d5", "ja": "おお、頼もしいな！", "zh": "喔喔，真是太可靠了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "1c547234da70195c0ef32d65952d87a21d9809b2e2ccf82e9edd3a643c8c9eda", "ja": "えへへ。だって、新しくやって来る後輩って、\n妹みたいなものですよね？", "zh": "嘿嘿，因为之后要进来的新人，\n就像是我们的妹妹一样对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "262f9a663f0eda9554b2da443896c3d6b4a98e445ef3a32a794ef174fae23a5f", "ja": "私、いつも家で妹弟の世話をしてますから、\n妹みたいな子達の面倒を見るのも得意かなーって。", "zh": "我在家时总是在照顾弟弟妹妹，我想\n照顾像妹妹一样的人应该也挺得心应手──这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5cb4f94ca7d4d7b02a21c79c9e8abeae23dfd08bc14f68eded0c80a3e7c77cd7", "ja": "はは、そういうことか。ちなみに妹だけじゃなくて、\nお姉さんも増えることになるぞ。", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这样。顺带一提，会变多的\n可不是只有妹妹，姊姊也会增加喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "8cc88de203a33bacb62ff26172e9b2c15df7474ecf5613080d0da7ba4247b5f7", "ja": "えっ。そうなんですか？\nお姉さん……。私に、お姉さんが……。", "zh": "咦？是这样子吗？\n姊姊……我要有姊姊了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "aa223960228271449bcb58efe1d6a07824900366a2a9fc87febe50b922d0fb0e", "ja": "{$P$}、私、なんだか……。\n顔がポッポして来ちゃいました～。", "zh": "{$P$}，我觉得……\n脸颊热起来了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0ad01d72f7dae0e9028325c33415825298a74ba6923b07ac7121c1a7f59e369a", "ja": "えっ、どうしてまた？\n何か恥ずかしがらせるようなこと、言ったっけ？", "zh": "咦？怎么会突然这样？\n我有说什么让你害羞的话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "5dbbc07efbc3e278e6922b660a2c8f81537aafb187e2e7ba9a5f7ffb42118e0e", "ja": "違います～。なんだか、うれしくなっちゃって。\n私、家では長女ですから。", "zh": "不是啦～我是觉得很开心。\n因为我在家里是长女。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "91d3c2e1dfecb5c3bd45d7f2c44beaa2ad0e6bfff5f7823d12e972acd4ac9ad2", "ja": "なるほど。たくさんお姉さんができたら、\nたくさん甘えられそうだな。", "zh": "这样啊。有了许多姊姊以后，\n你应该就能常常跟她们撒娇了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "3427b99d9cf41528cf75d09942979323d5866bdcedb74ea7086c4b564f501259", "ja": "そうですよねっ。たくさんのお姉さん……。\nえへへへ～。", "zh": "就是说啊，好多好多的姊姊……\n嘿嘿嘿～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "1e7c1798c229c5f6fd6c109efa528ef08de7d5d4687450bd5f6adc8b42218de9", "ja": "あっ。でも私、妹だけど先輩なんでした！\n先輩って……、甘えたりしちゃ、ダメですか？", "zh": "啊！可是我，虽然是妹妹但也是前辈！\n前辈……是不是不能跟她们撒娇呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_1020", "source_sha256": "f71674f056fad2ebb35185b65762596bf128d3cb576960efd1d39ea01fcea0b7", "ja": "そんなことはない", "zh": "没这回事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "e26753aaaead3f84e5f117ba3c0335f1ff8e8248ea7f30f7b0725228c362ba33", "ja": "そんなことないよ。\n甘えた分、支えてあげればいいんだから。", "zh": "没有这回事。\n你撒了多少娇，到时候就帮多少忙回去就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_2001_005yay", "source_sha256": "7cf499022e46e3b1e74be25f9cc2ede957949ac1805c6e7adeacf0414de3c2e5", "ja": "甘えた分、支える？\nどういうことですか？？", "zh": "撒娇，然后再帮忙回去？\n这是什么意思呀？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "d5db9a70340d5fd642da4916ee6dc54959ef94a08b7dd32768e5af9d59cbc722", "ja": "そうだな……。たとえばやよいの妹は、\n家でやよいに甘えたりするだろ？", "zh": "这个嘛……比方说弥生的妹妹，\n在家会跟弥生撒娇对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_2003_005yay", "source_sha256": "0e88019c6e84d082b538bad2875750e986994ddfcd119ec15c82cf17339e55d5", "ja": "えっと……。はい、カスミもまだ子どもだから、\nたまに甘えたくなっちゃうみたいです。", "zh": "我想想……嗯，霞年纪也还小，\n有时候是会想跟我撒娇的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_2004_005yay", "source_sha256": "89831aa93408e2fea5bccf9bcb22c36bfc92be8e680330376809c8d29cfdea26", "ja": "でも、私が家事で忙しくしてると、弟達の面倒を\n見てくれたりもして……助かるな～って。", "zh": "不过，当我在忙家事的时候，她也会帮忙\n照顾弟弟们……觉得有她在真好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_2005_p", "source_sha256": "662d7013e37e1325281233d27d63c190dc03f1f0e582a23fcb62177791d8f8df", "ja": "なるほど、家族みんなで助けあっているんだな。", "zh": "原来如此，一家人互助合作是吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_2006_005yay", "source_sha256": "1b7f26721b75e6eaaa72fe7abb6c678bd65b47fc36a03f3db41a92b9c438819f", "ja": "あっ、そっか！\n{$P$}、私、わかりました！", "zh": "啊，对耶！\n{$P$}，我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_2007_005yay", "source_sha256": "b6e57efb43d3c91d044e5a5de83566d69982c5412e925d2e793ed7bafebfcb5c", "ja": "妹の面倒もちゃんと見れて、\nお姉さん達にも頼ってもらえる……。", "zh": "能确实照顾好妹妹，\n同时也深受姊姊们的依赖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_2008_005yay", "source_sha256": "edb9c280d58807479cba39aefcde67b98a9202e16dd02249b7e5289e8204087d", "ja": "そんなカスミみたいな、しっかり者の妹を目指して、\n頑張ればいいんですよねっ？", "zh": "我只要努力成为像霞\n那样可靠的妹妹就行了，对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_2009_p", "source_sha256": "59334c88714edd7424f01806d8c339657b32ed70797eb34d98c4dc7fa6e76223", "ja": "そういうことだ。やよいぐらいしっかりした妹が\nいれば、きっとみんなも安心できるだろうからな。", "zh": "就是这么回事。有弥生这样可靠的妹妹，\n我想她们肯定也会备感心安的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "239f0fb1ec54e2b3b578970ebfa059ca9d60a3beb6da0fb945c06a7447007d35", "ja": "765プロの頼れる妹として、\nこれからも、よろしく頼むぞ！", "zh": "你作为765艺能的可靠妹妹，\n从今以后也要麻烦你关照啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_2011_005yay", "source_sha256": "787c7dc7aeeaa3e1ed756c5aaad427795efd0fed62a33e7d09543eb69f4a878d", "ja": "はーい！　姉妹みんなで仲良く支え合って、\n新しい劇場を盛り上げましょー！", "zh": "没问题～！姊妹们感情要好地互相扶持，\n让新剧场热闹起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_005yay_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_005yay_001_2012_p", "source_sha256": "ec6a5009f17741eab6d70bc7b6f81214a745b1e26e9d9eda099662e2ad508a59", "ja": "（お互いにフォローしあい、笑顔が絶えない劇場……。\nどんな未来になるのか、今から楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（彼此互相协助、笑声不绝于耳的剧场……\n我已经开始期待未来会是什么样子了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
